Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.44,0:00:02.34,Default,speaker_2,0,0,60,,Inacreditável.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.33,0:00:10.03,Default,speaker_1,0,0,60,,Não faça isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.49,0:00:12.24,Default,speaker_2,0,0,60,,Não se estresse tanto, fica calma.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.51,0:00:18.58,Default,speaker_2,0,0,60,,Aprenda a se divertir; se não der, ao menos\Ndemonstre.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.09,0:00:21.41,Default,speaker_1,0,0,60,,Você está me machucando.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.43,0:00:24.70,Default,speaker_2,0,0,60,,Çağla, vá se tratar. Você é insuportável.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:33.36,Default,speaker_1,0,0,60,,Rüya, como você está?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.38,0:00:34.36,Default,speaker_4,0,0,60,,Bem, e você?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:35.03,Default,speaker_1,0,0,60,,Tudo bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.46,0:00:36.30,Default,speaker_4,0,0,60,,Está indo bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.06,0:00:37.65,Default,speaker_1,0,0,60,,E você?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:38.45,Default,speaker_4,0,0,60,,Igual.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.10,0:00:40.98,Default,speaker_1,0,0,60,,Rüya, vamos embora.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.22,0:00:42.98,Default,speaker_4,0,0,60,,Por quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.24,0:00:44.81,Default,speaker_1,0,0,60,,Por quê? Por quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:48.93,Default,speaker_4,0,0,60,,Estou entediada. Vamos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.50,0:00:51.66,Default,speaker_1,0,0,60,,Também cansei de você, amiga.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.65,0:00:59.10,Default,speaker_3,0,0,60,,Alô, Çağla? Por que não atende?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.57,0:01:01.71,Default,speaker_3,0,0,60,,Chamei várias vezes, quase enlouqueci.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.95,0:01:03.99,Default,speaker_1,0,0,60,,Não é nada, mãe. Está tudo bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.17,0:01:04.82,Default,speaker_3,0,0,60,,Alaz?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.29,0:01:08.19,Default,speaker_1,0,0,60,,Alaz está bem. De bom humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.21,0:01:09.84,Default,speaker_3,0,0,60,,Sua voz está estranha.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.05,0:01:10.96,Default,speaker_3,0,0,60,,Aconteceu algo?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.13,0:01:14.44,Default,speaker_1,0,0,60,,Mãe, nada. A gente se diverte.
